## Phase 3: User Story 1 - Service Registration API

**User Story**: As a service owner, I want to register my service via REST API so that it can be tracked in the platform.

**Scenarios**: Scenario 1 (Register a New Service), Scenario 4 (Invalid Information)

**Test Criteria**:
- ✅ POST /api/v1/register accepts valid registration and returns registration ID with status 'pending'
- ✅ POST /api/v1/register rejects invalid inputs with HTTP 400 and clear error messages
- ✅ POST /api/v1/register is idempotent (returns existing registration ID for duplicate normalized names)
- ✅ Service name normalization works correctly (case-insensitive uniqueness)
- ✅ All validation rules from R6 are enforced

