- ✅ GET /api/v1/status/registration/{id} returns 'approved' for approved registrations
- ✅ GET /api/v1/status/registration/{id} returns 'denied' with comments for denied registrations
- ✅ GET /api/v1/status/registration/{id} returns HTTP 404 for non-existent registration IDs

