**Test Criteria**:
- ✅ GET /api/v1/services returns all non-deleted services
- ✅ GET /api/v1/services?name={name} filters by service name
- ✅ GET /api/v1/services?owner={owner} filters by owner
- ✅ GET /api/v1/services?healthStatus={status} filters by health status
- ✅ Search results exclude DELETED services (soft delete filter)

