**Scenarios**: Scenario 11 (Admin Reviews Services), Scenario 12 (Admin Processes Approvals), Scenario 13 (Service Owner Views Services)

**Test Criteria**:
- ✅ Dashboard Index page displays service count by health status
- ✅ Dashboard Index page shows filterable service table
- ✅ Dashboard PendingApprovals page lists pending registrations and deletions
- ✅ Dashboard ServiceDetail page shows full service metadata and heartbeat history
- ✅ Dashboard updates in near-real-time (<10s) when health status changes via SignalR
- ✅ Dashboard loads within 2 seconds

