## Phase 10: Deployment & Observability
### Phase 10: Deployment & Observability
**Goal**: Package application for deployment via Docker and Kubernetes, implement comprehensive logging.


### Phase 11: Deferred Service Updates & Change History (P2)

- T187: Refine requirements for service update flows (R19-R21, R23-R24)
